<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>@ViewData["Title"] - RedStar</title>
    @* The one shared Tailwind entry point (ClientApp/styles/app.css), linked once here rather
       than imported per-page -- see RedStar.WebApp/CLAUDE.md's "ClientApp/ conventions" (styling
       rule) for why. vite-href resolves to the Vite dev server in Development and to the hashed,
       manifest-resolved file in Production. *@
    <link rel="stylesheet" vite-href="~/styles/app.css" />
</head>
<body>
    <nav class="border-b border-slate-200 bg-white">
        <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-4xl items-center gap-6 px-4 py-3">
            <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">RedStar</span>
            <a class="text-sm text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900" href="/">Home</a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-8">
        @RenderBody()
    </main>

    @await RenderSectionAsync("Scripts", required: false)
</body>
</html>
